WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.075
Why no arrests?

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:04.512
Three structural failures.

00:00:04.512 --> 00:00:10.100
First, legislative immunity — the RCMP treats Parliament as untouchable.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:16.850
Second, just following orders — the violence was legal, so intervention was viewed as insubordinate.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:23.237
Third, state capture — when the state writes the laws, breaking them becomes impossible for the state.

00:00:23.237 --> 00:00:27.012
Canada lacks an independent enforcement mechanism.
